        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: British America, northeast North America, disputed border\n- Colonies: New York, New Hampshire\n- People: John Cruger Jr.\n- Roles: Speaker\n- Events: border skirmishes and raids, transition to royal colony\n\nFacts:\n- New York and New Hampshire had a series of skirmishes and raids between 1701 and 1765 along a disputed border.\n- John Cruger Jr. served as Speaker in the British proprietary colony of New York.\n- New York later became a royal colony in northeast North America.",
